{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12101190","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12101190","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1210119001:1":{"text":"Hey, pal. Catch anything today?","source_cn":"嘿，伙计，打听点事，今天有没有在海里捞上青头？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5CDDC05A9C8A1E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1210119002:1":{"text":"Nothing alive. A bunch of dead fish and stuff. It seems that another ship was attacked.","source_cn":"活的没有，死的不少。看来附近又有船遇袭了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B56C860DBFBD394","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210119003:1":{"text":"Who's that behind you?","source_cn":"你后面跟的什么人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3020DE9BF92035E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210119004:1":{"text":"Just a couple of landlubbers. One even has whiskers.","source_cn":"捡回来的旱鸭子，不，旱耗子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93673F3F310ABA3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210119005:1":{"text":"Hey, what did your lost friend look like?","source_cn":"喂，你们丢的那个人长什么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2775DDF0F2F4EFE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210119006:1":{"text":"Chippy's around my height. He's wearing armor and a helmet with a feather on top.","source_cn":"满满和我差不多高……穿着骑士的盔甲，戴有鸵羽的头盔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE872CF44F3BF236C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210119007:1":{"text":"Whoa! This thing can talk! That's amazing! How much do you want for it?","source_cn":"嘿，这小东西会说话！够稀奇！卖吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54F4C29C65162CA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1210119007":{"text":"Whoa! This thing can talk! That's amazing! How much do you want for it?","source_cn":"嘿，这小东西会说话！够稀奇！卖吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54F4C29C65162CA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210119008:1":{"text":"Sorry, I just never seen anyone like her before.","source_cn":"我就问问。长她这样的，没瞧见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB57793DA509A9F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1210119009:1":{"text":"Umm... you said someone in armor, right? I wouldn't hold my breath. You'd probably drown, swimming in something like that.","source_cn":"你们说还穿着骑士盔甲？那恐怕凶多吉少了。这么大的浪头，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36145EC8EEA58588","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1210119010:1":{"text":"No way! Chippy's fine! He's fine. Do you hear me?!","source_cn":"不！满满他不会有事的，不可能……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D4A4867B7A5EB7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1210119011:1":{"text":"Alright, alright. Thanks, buddy.","source_cn":"行，行，谢谢了，老兄！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F6E86EAEE9DD215","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1210119012:1":{"text":"I can't believe that man said that! The nerve!","source_cn":"那个人竟然、竟然说满满凶多吉少！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00705CAC689AE84D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1210119013:1":{"text":"I mean he does make sense. I was gonna say the same thing.","source_cn":"他说得很有道理，我本来也想那么说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9557D57DF923AE67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1210119014:1":{"text":"What?! You, too?!","source_cn":"什么？！你、连你也——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60810A4A5A11ADC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1210119015:1":{"text":"Alright, alright, calm down. I found both of you alive, didn't I? So, you never know.","source_cn":"别急别急，道理是那么讲，不过，万一呢？毕竟我都把你们两...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4566394C8D381859","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1210119016:0":{"text":"There are other docks in the city. Maybe your friend washed up somewhere else. When there's a shipwreck, we try to save as many as we can...","source_cn":"城里还有其他码头，也许你们的同伴被冲到其他地方去了。遇...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5390D6FA6AEADBD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1210119017:1":{"text":"Let's see... Let's head over there.","source_cn":"我看看……往这边走。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3ACAA52A937281EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"Hammie is my familiar!","source_cn":"漫漫是我的使魔！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1DCE63D15BDCC8C6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Hammie is my familiar!","female":"Hammie is my familiar!","variant_male_record_index":"65290","variant_female_record_index":"65291","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:1:2":{"text":"Hammie is my friend!